("v254", "type", "String")
("v254", "scalar", "I can be busy doing things for a child and still miss the person asking for my attention. The question I want to keep near is small enough to belong in an ordinary day: am I here with you, or only managing what happens next?")
("v253", "item", "v254")
("v252", "value", "v253")
