("v261", "type", "Sequence")
("v262", "type", "String")
("v262", "scalar", "Being Dad gives care a particular responsibility. There is power in being the adult: the ability to decide, explain, protect, hurry, refuse. I want that power to help another person grow a life of their own. These are commitments I want to practise, with room to notice where my actions fall short.")
