("v428", "type", "Entry")
("v428", "key", "children")
("v429", "type", "Sequence")
("v430", "type", "String")
("v430", "scalar", "Attention is not a performance of endless availability. Work, tiredness and other responsibilities are real. I can be honest about a limit and make a promise I can keep: I cannot do this now; here is when I will come back. The return matters as much as the promise.")
("v429", "item", "v430")
("v428", "value", "v429")
