("v468", "type", "Sequence")
("v469", "type", "String")
("v469", "scalar", "A child’s growing will belongs in the relationship. I do not want agreement with me to become the measure of whether they are good, safe to love or worth hearing. Disagreement can be something we learn to handle together.")
("v468", "item", "v469")
("v467", "value", "v468")
("v441", "item", "v462")
