("v477", "type", "String")
("v477", "scalar", "There are still boundaries to hold. Protecting someone, stopping harm and accepting the responsibility to decide can be part of care. The question is whether a boundary serves the person and the situation, or mainly protects my convenience, pride or need to be obeyed.")
("v476", "item", "v477")
("v475", "value", "v476")
("v441", "item", "v470")
