("v484", "type", "Sequence")
("v485", "type", "String")
("v485", "scalar", "When I can offer a real choice, I want it to be real. When I cannot, I should say so without disguising an instruction as a question. Room to grow depends partly on knowing which choices are actually open.")
("v484", "item", "v485")
