("v593", "key", "children")
("v594", "type", "Sequence")
("v595", "type", "String")
("v595", "scalar", "Repair also needs something beyond a sentence. A kept commitment, a changed habit or a boundary that becomes clearer gives the words a place in what follows. I can return without pretending that the difficult moment never happened.")
("v594", "item", "v595")
("v593", "value", "v594")
