("v1385", "type", "String")
("v1385", "scalar", "That does not remove the need for judgment. Someone still chooses what a term means and whether the definition is suitable. I want those choices to have names, sources and versions, so another person can ask what has been assumed and what an edit would alter.")
("v1384", "item", "v1385")
("v1383", "value", "v1384")
