("v1487", "scalar", "A passing test should have a readable scope. It may show that a calculation reproduces, that a document preserves its structure or that a request was checked against a particular rule. Those are useful achievements. Their names should match their reach.")
("v1486", "item", "v1487")
("v1485", "value", "v1486")
