("v1542", "type", "String")
("v1542", "scalar", "Change needs memory. I want to be able to ask which definition was active, what someone proposed, who accepted it and what the system actually did. A useful history preserves differences instead of compressing them into a story in which everything was always intended.")
("v1541", "item", "v1542")
("v1540", "value", "v1541")
