("v1556", "key", "children")
("v1557", "type", "Sequence")
("v1558", "type", "String")
("v1558", "scalar", "The engineering question is therefore specific: what can be reversed, what needs a new decision, and what requires repair outside the software? I want that question in the design before the first confident click.")
("v1557", "item", "v1558")
("v1556", "value", "v1557")
