("v2299", "key", "children")
("v2300", "type", "Sequence")
("v2301", "type", "String")
("v2301", "scalar", "I can also choose a more general scene when a lesson does not need a private history. That distance can give a reader room to recognise something without requiring them to inherit the author’s circumstances or conclusions.")
