("v2505", "type", "String")
("v2505", "scalar", "Revision can begin with a sentence and reach the frame around it. Whose account became too convenient? Which consequence did I avoid? Does the scene invite attention, or keep pressing the reader toward the response I wanted?")
("v2504", "item", "v2505")
("v2503", "value", "v2504")
("v2477", "item", "v2498")
