("v2560", "type", "String")
("v2560", "scalar", "Worldwright is the developing platform for this kind of storytelling: a composition whose scenes, relationships and routes can be inspected. The present site is one evolving use of that idea, with working examples and unfinished joins.")
("v2559", "item", "v2560")
("v2558", "value", "v2559")
